    {
      "id": "text-funding",
      "type": "shadcnTextInfo",
      "position": { "x": 30, "y": 50 },
      "data": {
        "content": "## Step 1: Open a Payment Channel\n\nAlice and Bob want to send payments instantly — without touching the blockchain every time.\n\nThey lock funds into a shared 2-of-2 multisig. Neither can spend alone.\n\n👉 The private keys auto-generate above. Watch the public keys derive from them.\n\nThese public keys form a shared vault — both signatures are required to spend.\n\n→ Next: how do you safely send a payment across a network without trust?",
        "fontSize": 36,
        "width": 550,
        "height": 600,
        "title": "Text Info Node",
        "dirty": false
      },
      "width": 550,
      "height": 600,
      "parentId": "group-funding",
      "extent": "parent"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-htlc",
      "type": "shadcnTextInfo",
      "position": { "x": 30, "y": 50 },
      "data": {
        "content": "## Step 2: Route a Payment Without Trust (HTLC)\n\nAlice is not paying Bob directly — the payment may pass through intermediaries.\n\nTo make this safe, Bitcoin uses a contract with two possible outcomes:\n\n**Door A (Success):** Reveal the secret preimage → funds released instantly  \n**Door B (Timeout):** Wait until block height passes → sender reclaims funds  \n\n👉 Try it:\n- Enter a hex value as Preimage (e.g. 68656c6c6f)\n- Enter a future block height (e.g. 900000)\n\nWatch the hash compute and the HTLC script assemble.\n\nThis guarantees: every hop either gets paid or no one does.\n\n→ Next: how the contract is actually spent.",
        "fontSize": 36,
        "width": 550,
        "height": 700,
        "title": "Text Info Node",
        "dirty": false
      },
      "width": 550,
      "height": 700,
      "parentId": "group-htlc",
      "extent": "parent"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-success",
      "type": "shadcnTextInfo",
      "position": { "x": 30, "y": 50 },
      "data": {
        "content": "## Step 3A: Success Path — Reveal the Secret\n\nThe receiver knows the preimage and reveals it to unlock the funds.\n\n👉 Enter the SAME preimage used in Step 2.\n\nThe Success Spend Script assembles — this satisfies the hash condition.\n\nNo waiting. No ambiguity. Payment completes instantly.\n\nIn Lightning, this secret propagates backward across the route — settling all hops atomically.",
        "fontSize": 36,
        "width": 500,
        "height": 500,
        "title": "Text Info Node",
        "dirty": false
      },
      "width": 500,
      "height": 500,
      "parentId": "group-success",
      "extent": "parent"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-timeout",
      "type": "shadcnTextInfo",
      "position": { "x": 30, "y": 50 },
      "data": {
        "content": "## Step 3B: Timeout Path — Reclaim Funds\n\nIf the secret is never revealed, the contract expires.\n\n👉 Enter the SAME block height from Step 2.\n\nOnce the block height is reached, the refund path unlocks.\n\nThe Timeout Spend Script assembles — returning funds safely.\n\nNo trust required. Bitcoin enforces the rules.",
        "fontSize": 36,
        "width": 500,
        "height": 500,
        "title": "Text Info Node",
        "dirty": false
      },
      "width": 500,
      "height": 500,
      "parentId": "group-timeout",
      "extent": "parent"
    },
